  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;<strong>需要安装 Minecraft Forge。</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>自 1.19.2-5.2.0 版本起，建议搭配</strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Patchouli</strong></a></span>&nbsp;</strong></span><strong>使用。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;本模组添加了大量日式方块、物品、生物等。</p>\n<p>如需了解更多关于本模组的信息，请阅读 <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fonl.bz%252fMVGfr7Y\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Japan Wiki (日本語/Japanese)</a><span style=\"color:#fff\">。</span></span></p>\n<p>如需反馈问题或提问，请在 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.gd%252f3Y5fx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iwaliner 专属联系 Discord 服务器</a></strong></span> 上告知我。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>添加了大量和风建材与食物等。<br>魔法元素目前仍在开发中，内容尚不完善。</p>\n<p><strong>自 1.19.2-5.2.0 版本起，</strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a></span> </strong></span><strong>强烈建议同时安装。安装后将可获取指南书。<br>想了解食谱、教程等关于漆MOD（Urushi MOD）的详细信息，请查看<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.gd%252fwTGkx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">漆MOD官方Wiki</a></span></strong>。</p>\n<p>我们还设有<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/wR5qf7JprH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">漆MOD官方 Discord 服务器</a></span></strong>。<br>BUG 反馈、提问及其他联络请前往<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.gd%252f3Y5fx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iwaliner 专属联系 Discord 服务器</a></span></strong>。<br>漆MOD 官方周边商品正在 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fiwaliner.booth.pm%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Booth</a></span> 发售中！</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>其他 Urushi MOD 相关链接 &darr;  &darr;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforum.civa.jp%252fviewtopic.php%253ft%253d1170\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Japan Forum (日本語/Japanese)</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fonl.bz%252fMVGfr7Y\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Japan Wiki (日本語/Japanese)</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mcmod.cn%252fclass%252f8924.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC百科 (中文/Chinese)</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://twitter.com/iwaliner_MC\" rel=\"nofollow\">作者 Twitter (日本語/Japanese)</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GI3jkGKb0AAFYyn?format=jpg&name=large\" width=\"563\" height=\"294\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fl3_hbOaMAEzE3T?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"推拉门\" width=\"563\" height=\"331\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fxd-nUJaUAAzxzd?format=jpg&name=large\" width=\"563\" height=\"316\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fj2CYYmUoAAxQfn?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"可连接方块\" width=\"563\" height=\"331\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FhFdqbLUcAEBUkJ?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"通往隐世的传送门\" width=\"563\" height=\"294\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FNEp3eraAAAZjMT?format=png&name=900x900\" width=\"563\" height=\"317\">&nbsp; 在水田中种植水稻！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FeoYblaVEAANO_F?format=jpg&name=medium\" width=\"563\" height=\"563\">&nbsp; 种植孟宗竹（日本黑竹）！</p>\n<p>在泥土熔炉中蒸煮米饭！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FgcbZQbUYAA1t4Z?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"隐世维度中的洞穴\" width=\"563\" height=\"294\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
